    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praedātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				taking of booty</i>, <i>plundering</i>, <i>pillaging</i> (post-Aug.).— In
				plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latrociniis ac praedationibus infestato mari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 73, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 12, 29</span></i>. —In
				sing., <i><span class="en">Lact. 5,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Isa. 9, 5</span></i>.</div>
